    <string name="home_data_missing">The game is ready, but its game files (DATA) are missing. Select your own PAL (RMCP01) disc image to extract them, or import a game file from your computer that includes them.\n\nThe game files go to:\n%1$s</string>
    <string name="home_import">Import from computer</string>
    <string name="home_setup_intro">Nothing from Mario Kart Wii comes with this app: each game is built from your own PAL (RMCP01) disc.\n\nOn this headset: copy your disc image (ISO, WBFS, RVZ…) here, for example into Download, press Select disc image, then Build on this Quest.\n\nWith a computer: in the WiiCompiled VR launcher, use Build for Quest with your disc image, copy the .wcgame file it makes to this headset, then press Import from computer. Retro Rewind also needs its pack, which this app can download from Retro Rewind\'s own server, or a Retro Rewind game file can carry.</string>
    <string name="home_game_missing">The game files are ready. Now build this game from them: Build on this Quest takes about 30–40 minutes on a Quest 3. With a computer, use Build for Quest in the WiiCompiled VR launcher instead, copy the .wcgame file to this headset and press Import from computer.</string>
    <string name="home_game_stale">This app was updated, so the game must be built again for it: press Build on this Quest, or use Build for Quest in the WiiCompiled VR launcher again and Import from computer.</string>
    <string name="home_mod_needed_title">Retro Rewind needs its pack</string>
    <string name="home_mod_needed_message">Retro Rewind needs its pack (the RetroRewind6 folder) on this headset. It can be downloaded here from Retro Rewind\'s own server, or arrive with a Retro Rewind game file built with the pack included.</string>
    <string name="home_download_mod_pack">Download Retro Rewind</string>
    <string name="home_mod_pack_title">Download the Retro Rewind pack?</string>
    <string name="home_mod_pack_message">Retro Rewind\'s tracks, characters and code come from Retro Rewind\'s own distribution server, the same one the computer launcher uses. That is about 2 GB over Wi‑Fi.\n\nNothing from Retro Rewind comes with this app.</string>
    <string name="home_mod_pack_update_message">Retro Rewind publishes updates the same way it publishes the pack. Only what changed since version %1$s is downloaded.</string>
    <string name="home_mod_pack_downloading">Downloading %1$d%%</string>
    <string name="home_mod_pack_running">Downloading the Retro Rewind pack from its own server. It carries on if you close this panel.</string>
