    <string name="home_build_message">The game is built on this headset from your own disc files. It takes about 30–40 minutes on a Quest 3 and uses most of its memory, so close other apps and keep the headset on its charger.\n\nThe first build downloads about 10 MB of Android build files from Google.</string>
