    <string name="about_app_name">WiiCompiled OpenXR VR</string>
    <string name="about_app_summary">Mario Kart Wii recompiled to native code, with an OpenXR renderer, running on this headset. No game code and no game data come with it: each game is built from the disc you own.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_vr">Meta Quest port and the OpenXR VR renderer by iChris4.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_hand_steering">The cockpit\'s turning steering wheel and hand steering by heurazy, from mario-kart-wii-VR-port (GPL v3).</string>
    <string name="about_credit_wiicompiled">WiiCompiled, the static recompilation this is built on, by patchzyy and the static recompilation community.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_retro_rewind">Retro Rewind by ZPL and team, the mod distribution this app can download and play.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_wheel_wizard">Wheel Wizard by Patchzy and WantToBeeMe, the PC launcher this panel is modelled on.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_aurora">aurora by encounter (MIT) with Google\'s Dawn: the graphics layer every frame goes through.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_openxr">The OpenXR SDK by Khronos, and SDL 3 for windowing, audio and controllers.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_nod">nod by encounter, which reads your disc image, built into this app as libnod_jni.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_mod_browser">The Patches page\'s mod browser finds mods on GameBanana, as Wheel Wizard\'s does. Their .7z and .rar archives are unpacked by sevenz-rust2 (Apache 2.0) and rars by bitplane (MIT or Apache 2.0), built into libnod_jni.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_profiles">My profiles reads your licences from Retro Rewind\'s save, and shows each one\'s Mii picture, VR history and online status from Retro WFC (rwfc.net), as Wheel Wizard does. Badges come from Wheel Wizard\'s data.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_miis">My Miis edits the game\'s Mii database, and its Mii editor works as Wheel Wizard\'s. Miis are drawn by a port of Wheel Wizard\'s Mii renderer (GPL v3), from FFL\'s Mii parts, which you download from the Internet Archive\'s copy of Miitomo\'s files, and the 3DS Mii bodies, which you download from Wheel Wizard\'s repository.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_toolchain">On-headset builds use Termux\'s Android clang and lld, Google\'s Android NDK headers and libraries, and .NET for the translator.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_dolphin">The Dolphin emulator, the reference for how the Wii behaves.</string>
    <string name="about_credit_logo">The WiiCompiled logo by inkwreck.</string>
    <string name="about_licence_text">GNU General Public License v3. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or associated with Nintendo. Mario Kart Wii is a trademark of Nintendo.</string>
    <string name="about_kit">Game kit</string>
    <string name="about_credit_title_vr">Meta Quest and VR</string>
